:: Livestock Cell
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<set $bus to "livestock">>

당신은 헛간 안의 감옥에 있다. 마실 수 있는 깨끗한 물이 담긴 양동이와 잠잘 수 있는 짚더미가 있다.
<<if $livestock.lock.unlocked is false or $livestock.lock.keys is true and $livestock.lock.unlocked is undefined>>
	<span class="teal"> 당신은 짚더미 속에 열쇠 꾸러미를 숨겨두었다.</span>
<<elseif $livestock.lock.unlocked is true>>
	<span class="teal"> 감옥 문이 잠겨 있지 않다. 당신은 짚더미 속에 열쇠 꾸러미를 숨겨두었다.</span>
<</if>>


<br><br>

<<if Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 18>>
	헛간의 수용자들이 레미의 감시 아래 밖으로 몰아지고 있다.
<<elseif Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 21>>
	<!-- Modified for Monster People -->
	<<if victimsAlwaysMonsterForType("cow") or monsterCanAppearForType("cow")>>
		<<livestock_cows "cap">>【이가】 감옥 가장자리에 줄을 서고, 농장 일꾼들이 그들의 몸에 착유기를 부착한다.
	<<else>>
		<<livestock_cows "cap">>【이가】 감옥 가장자리에 줄을 서고, 농장 일꾼들이 그들의 몸에 착유기를 부착한다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	소들의 코 고는 소리가 복도를 채운다.
<</if>>
<<if $uncomfortable.nude is true>><<covered>><</if>>
<br><br>

<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "remy">>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutremy>>
	<<if Time.hour gte 5 and Time.hour lt 18>>
		<<hunger 1000>>
		<<set $livestock.noise to false>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 18>>
	<<set $livestock.noise to false>>
	레미와 농장 일꾼들이 헛간을 돌며 감옥 문을 열고 수용자들을 풀어준다. 그중 한 명이 당신의 감옥 문을 연다.
	<br><br>

	<<getouticon>><<link [[감옥을 나선다|Livestock Cell Leave]]>><<livestock_obey 1>><</link>><<gobey>>
	<br>
	<<refuseicon>><<link [[나가기를 거부한다|Livestock Cell Refuse]]>><<livestock_obey -1>><<pain 6>><</link>><<lobey>><<gpain>>
	<br>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 21>>
/* once every 4 days after pc's been missing for more than they have permissions for, when eden cares strongly enough to leave the forest and go all the way to the farmlands. */
	<<if $daily.eden is undefined>>
		<<set $daily.eden = {}>>
	<</if>>

	<<if (Time.days % 4) is 0 and $daily.eden.farmRescue isnot 1 and C.npc.Eden.love gte 120 and edenFreedomStatus() gte 1>>
		<<npc Eden>><<person1>>
		You feel a draft as Remy opens the gate and enters your cell. A hat drifts to your feet. Before you know what to do, something else <<if 150 - $submissive / 20 lt C.npc.Eden.dom>>commands<<else>>draws<</if>> your attention.
		<br><br>
		<span class="green">You hear Eden's voice,</span> arguing with someone near the front of the barn.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Shout for Eden|Eden Shout]]>><<npcincr Eden dom 5>><<set $daily.eden.farmRescue to 1>><<livestock_obey -20>><</link>><<lllobey>><<gggdom>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Ignore it|Eden Shout Ignore]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<set $daily.eden.farmRescue to 1>><<livestock_obey 5>><</link>><<ggobey>>

	<<else>>

		<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
		레미가 눈을 똑바로 맞추며 <<= $livestock.obey lte 30 ? "성큼성큼 걸어온다" : "걸어온다">>. "<<= $livestock.obey lte 30 ? "골치 아픈 가축이란 말이지" : "이 녀석은 내가 직접 다루지">>. " 감옥에 들어온 <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "<<if $livestock.obey lte 30>>그러니 내가 직접 다뤄주마. <</if>>이리 와."
		<br><br>
		<<if $livestock.obey gte 80 and C.npc.Remy.love gte 50 and random(1,100) gte 60 and !playerChastity() and $livestock.pride is 1>>
			<<link [[따른다|Livestock Milking Obey]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<livestock_obey 5>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<ggobey>>
			<br>
			<<link [[거부한다|Livestock Milking Refuse]]>><<npcincr Remy dom -1>><<livestock_obey -5>><</link>><<lobey>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[따른다|Livestock Milking Obey]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<livestock_obey 5>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<ggobey>>
			<br>
			<<link [[거부한다|Livestock Milking Refuse]]>><<npcincr Remy dom -1>><<livestock_obey -5>><</link>><<lobey>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

	<</if>>

<<else>>

	<<if $livestock.lock.intro is undefined>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[감방을 살펴본다|Livestock Lock Examine]]>><</link>>

	<<elseif $livestock.lock.keys is true and $livestock.lock.unlocked is undefined>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[열쇠를 시도해본다|Livestock Lock Key]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>

	<<elseif $livestock.lock.keys is true and $livestock.lock.unlocked is false>>
		<<lockicon "bronze key">><<link [[감방을 연다|Livestock Lock Key]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>

	<<elseif $livestock.lock.unlocked is true>>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[감방을 나선다|Livestock Lock Examine]]>><</link>>

	<<else>>
		<<getinicon>><<link [[문으로 다가간다|Livestock Lock Examine]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<exerciseicon>><<link [[운동한다 (1:00)|Livestock Workout]]>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br>
	<<if $livestock.noise is false>>
		<<socialiseicon "angry">><<link [[소란을 피운다 (0:10)|Livestock Noise]]>><<pass 10>><<stress -12>><<trauma -6>><<set $livestock.noise to true>><</link>><<llstress>><<ltrauma>><<lobey>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[새벽까지 잔다|Livestock Sleep]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<ltiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<autism-stim "Livestock Cell">>
	<<ind>><<link [[게임플레이 설정|Livestock Settings]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<attitudesControlCheck>>
	<<if $attitudesControl.showGoldLink is true>>
		<<ind>><span class="goldLink"><<link [[태도|Attitudes]]>><<set $attitudesExitPassage to $passage>><</link>> </span><span class="red">!!</span>
	<<else>>
		<<ind>><<link [[태도|Attitudes]]>><<set $attitudesExitPassage to $passage>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>



:: Eden Shout Ignore
<<effects>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
당신은 그 목소리를 무시한다. 레미가 모자를 주워 주인에게 돌려주자, 그 사람은 <<him>>에게 고맙다고 말하고 떠난다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Livestock Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Eden Shout
<<effects>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Eden>><<person1>>
<<set $edenshoutrescue to 1>>
"에덴!" 당신이 소리치자 레미와 주변 사람들이 놀란다. "도와줘!" 한 인물이 농장 인부들을 헤치고 당신 쪽으로 온다. 한 명이 <<him>>【을를】 막으려 하지만, 옆으로 밀쳐진다.
<br><br>

당신은 모자를 움켜쥐고 에덴에게 달려간다. 대부분의 농장 인부들은 소들을 돌보느라 바쁘지만, 레미는 <<nnpc_his "Remy">> 옆구리의 채찍을 더듬으며 당신을 쫓는다.
<br><br>
에덴이 바로 앞에 있다. 채찍 소리가 들리고, 채찍이 당신의 발목을 감아 넘어뜨린다. 에덴이 앞으로 뛰어들어 한 팔로 당신을 붙잡는다. <<He>>【은는】 멈추지 않고 계속 나아간다.
<br><br>
고개를 들어보니 에덴의 주먹이 레미의 턱에 꽂히는 것이 보인다.
<br><br>
레미는 흙바닥에 쓰러진다. 에덴은 당신이 제대로 설 수 있도록 도와주고, 함께 헛간을 탈출한다.
<br><br>
<<pass 1>><<He>>【은는】 당신을 이끌고 울타리에 뚫린 구멍으로 빠져나간다. 잠시 후 등 뒤에서 날카로운 휘파람 소리와 함께 고함 소리, 개 짖는 소리가 들려온다. 레미의 고통스러운 목소리가 다른 소리들 위로 울려 퍼진다. <span class="red">당신은 추격당하고 있습니다.</span><<lllobey>><<livestock_obey -20>>
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Livestock Eden Escape]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Livestock Settings [exitCheckBypass]
<<if $options.images is 1>>
	<span id="bannerStyle">
		<img class="resize" src="img/misc/banner.png">
	</span>
<</if>>
<<set $settingsExitPassage to "Livestock Cell">>
<<settings>>

:: Livestock Workout
<<effects>>
<<if $livestock.noise is true>>
	<<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>>
	바닥에서 일어나려 하지만, 그대로 쓰러져 버린다. 벌을 받은 탓에 몸을 거의 움직일 수 없다. 지금 당장 운동하는 것은 불가능할 것이다.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[다음|Livestock Cell]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	감옥 안에는 기본적인 운동을 할 만한 공간이 충분하다. 당신은 땀을 흘리며 스스로를 몰아붙여, 감금된 상황을 잊으려 한다.
	<<physique 6>>
	<<pass 60>><<tiredness 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<if Time.hour lte 5>>
		<<link [[계속 운동한다 (1:00)|Livestock Workout]]>><</link>><<gtiredness>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[그만둔다|Livestock Cell]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Livestock Noise
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	Panic and frustration finally spill over. Like a caged animal, you lash out inside your cell, <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>mooing<<else>>yelling<</if>> as loudly as you can<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> despite your $worn.face.name<</if>>. You kick through the straw and beat your hands against the metal lining until the sound rings through the barn.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You try to stay quiet at first. The pressure only builds until it bursts out of you in a frightened, ragged <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>cry<</if>><<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> muffled by your $worn.face.name<</if>>. Once the noise starts, you cannot stop yourself from kicking straw aside and striking the metal walls of your cell.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	You try to make the noise sound like a protest rather than a tantrum. It does not last. Your voice rises into a raw <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>shout<</if>><<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> against your $worn.face.name<</if>>, and soon you're kicking straw across the floor and hammering the metal lining hard enough to wake the barn.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	If they insist on treating you like livestock, you decide the whole barn can hear your review. You make a noisy spectacle of your cell, <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>mooing<<else>>yelling<</if>><<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> through your $worn.face.name<</if>>, kicking straw everywhere, and striking the metal lining in a furious rhythm.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You choose the loudest way to remind them you are still a person. You slam your hands against the metal lining, kick straw across the floor, and <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>shout<</if>> until your throat strains<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> against your $worn.face.name<</if>>.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	Like a caged animal, you lash out inside your cell. You <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>yell<</if>> as loudly as possible<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> despite your $worn.face.name<</if>>, tear up your straw, and smack against the metal lining hard enough to make the whole barn listen.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You turn your cell into a threat. Each strike against the metal lining lands harder than the last, and your <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>yell<</if>><<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> through your $worn.face.name<</if>> comes out sharp with spite. If Remy wants obedience, <<he>> can hear exactly how little of it you have left.
<<else>>
	Like a caged animal, you lash out inside your cell. You <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>yell<</if>> as loudly as possible<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> despite your $worn.face.name<</if>>, quickly waking the other bovine from their slumber. You turn up your hay and smack against the metal lining, causing a lot of noise.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Soon, the whole barn begins to join in your rebellious antics, some out of annoyance, others out of their apparent mistreatment.
<br><br>
얼마 지나지 않아 헛간 문이 열리고 불이 깜빡이며 켜진다. 레미와 두 명의 농장 인부가 소들을 살피자, 모두 재빨리 '침대'로 돌아간다. 제자리에 서 있는 것은 당신뿐이고, 당신이 주동자로 지목된다.
<br><br>
<<if $livestock.obey gte 80>>
	<<link [[다음|Livestock Noise 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Livestock Noise 2]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Livestock Noise 2
<<livestock_obey -5>>
<<npc Remy>><<person1>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	Your cell door opens, and the farmhands rush in to restrain your arms. Remy follows with a handkerchief already damp with something sharp-smelling from the flask in <<his>> hand.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		Terrified, you <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>beg<</if>> for mercy<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> through your $worn.face.name<</if>>, but the plea breaks off as the cloth is pressed over your mouth.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		You shrink back with a frightened sound, trying to make yourself small even as the farmhands seize your arms. The cloth smothers the apology before it can become words.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You start blurting apologies before the cloth even reaches you, promising to behave if they'll just stop. The handkerchief cuts every word short.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
		You try to demand an explanation, or at least a little dignity, but the farmhands pin you fast and the cloth silences the objection.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
		You manage one scandalised objection before the farmhands pin you fast. The cloth presses over your mouth, reducing the performance to a muffled, furious noise.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		You flail your arms and jerk your head away, but your protests vanish beneath the cloth pressed hard against your mouth.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		You twist sharply and try to wrench free, spitting out a flat refusal, but the farmhands hold you steady and force your face into the drugged cloth.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		You bare your teeth and spit a curse at Remy, but <<he>> only watches as the cloth is forced over your mouth and nose.
	<<else>>
		당신은 목을 빼지만, 농장 인부들이 당신의 머리를 붙잡고 천에 얼굴을 억지로 들이밀게 한다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Remy watches as you struggle in silence. "What's gotten into you?" <<His>> green eyes pin you in place even as your vision starts to swim. "You're usually so well-behaved."
	<br><br>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		Fear knots in your chest. You try to hold onto the thought that you only wanted to be heard, but it slips away beneath the fog.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		A miserable part of you wants to nod, apologise, and make this easier for everyone. The drug steals even that from you.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
		You fight to keep your composure, but the edges of the barn smear and tilt around you.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
		You try to hold onto one last dramatic glare, but the barn blurs before you can make it convincing.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		You glare back as long as you can, refusing to give <<him>> the satisfaction of seeing you fold first.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		You measure your breathing and try to stay upright through stubborn will alone. It is not enough.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		You try to memorise the look on <<his>> face through the haze, clinging to the anger even as your body weakens.
	<<else>>
		The barn swims before your eyes as the drug works its way through you.
	<</if>>
	더 이상 약을 견딜 수 없게 된 당신은 무릎을 꿇는다. 레미는 만족한 듯 물러선다.
	<br><br>
	"눕혀서 쉬게 해. 이 행동이 버릇이 되는지 지켜보자고." 레미가 지시한다. 당신은 건초 더미 위로 부드럽게 눕혀지고, 발은 바닥에 질질 끌린다.
	<br><br>
	<<if $loveInterest.primary isnot "None">>
		어둠이 시야를 덮쳐올 때, 당신의 마지막 생각은 <<if $loveInterest.primary is "Black Wolf" or $loveInterest.primary is "Great Hawk">>그<</if>> <<= window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($loveInterest.primary)>>【을를】 향한다. 과연 다시 <<if $loveInterest.primary is "Black Wolf">>무리를<<else>><<nnpc_him $loveInterest.primary>>【을를】 볼 수 있을까.<</if>>
	<<else>>
		Darkness pours over your thoughts until even panic dulls and your consciousness fades.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[다음|Livestock Sleep]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Your cell door opens, and the farmhands rush in to restrain your arms. Remy walks in behind them, calmly unfurling <<his>> whip.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		Terrified, you <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>beg<</if>> for mercy<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>> through your $worn.face.name<</if>>, but your cries break apart as the whip meets your
		<<if playerBellySize(true) gte 8>>
			엉덩이를 때리면서 끊긴다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 <<bellyDescription "pc">>【을를】 피하기 위해 특별히 조심한다.
		<<else>>
			배를 때리면서 끊긴다.
		<</if>>
		You <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6)>>moo<<else>>gasp<</if>> in pain as Remy punishes you with all <<his>> fury. You hang your head in resignation and sob, every strike unleashing a fresh stream of tears.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		You fold inward the moment the whip appears, arms shaking in the farmhands' grip. The first crack lands across your
		<<if playerBellySize(true) gte 8>>
			엉덩이를 때리면서 끊긴다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 <<bellyDescription "pc">>【을를】 피하기 위해 특별히 조심한다.
		<<else>>
			배를 때리면서 끊긴다.
		<</if>>
		The sound that leaves you is small and broken, but each lash drags another one out.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You stammer out apologies, promising obedience, but the whip cracks across your
		<<if playerBellySize(true) gte 8>>
			엉덩이를 때리면서 끊긴다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 <<bellyDescription "pc">>【을를】 피하기 위해 특별히 조심한다.
		<<else>>
			배를 때리면서 끊긴다.
		<</if>>
		Each lash makes your body jolt. By the third you are already trembling, your promises dissolving into pained little noises.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
		You try to protest with what dignity you can muster, but the first crack of the whip steals the breath from you as it lands across your
		<<if playerBellySize(true) gte 8>>
			엉덩이를 때리면서 끊긴다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 <<bellyDescription "pc">>【을를】 피하기 위해 특별히 조심한다.
		<<else>>
