		<</if>>
		<<link [[복종한다|Livestock Lactate Obey]]>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<livestock_obey 1>><<sub 1>><<transform cow 1>><</link>><<gobey>>
		<br>
		<<link [[거부한다|Livestock Lactate Refuse]]>><<npcincr Remy dom -1>><<livestock_obey -1>><<def 1>><</link>><<lobey>>
