:: Livestock Escape Thank
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Th-Thank you for rescuing me," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Thank you," you say softly. "Really."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"Thank you for coming for me," you say, still half out of breath.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	"That was very nearly heroic," you say, voice shaking despite the flourish. "Thank you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Took you long enough," you say. "But... thanks."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Thanks for saving me," you say, meeting <<his>> eyes properly this time.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"You picked a hell of a moment to show up," you say. "Thanks."
<<else>>
	"구해주셔서 감사합니다." 당신이 말한다.
<</if>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	Relief makes your voice wobble more than you'd like.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You almost thank <<him>> again, but the first one already took more strength than expected.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	The words come easier than expected, pulled loose by sheer relief.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	The attempt at flair can't hide how badly your hands are shaking.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident")>>
	You try to keep the gratitude from sounding too raw, and only mostly succeed.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	The thanks tastes strange on your tongue, but not wrong.
<<else>>
	For the first time since the chase began, breathing feels possible again.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"I enjoyed it," <<he>> says, turning back toward the farm. "Remy needs to learn that <<person1>><<his>> authority has limits." 
<br><br>
With that, <<person2>><<he>> dashes forward. <<He>> looks back as <<he>> crests the hill.<<lltrauma>><<lllstress>><<trauma -24>><<stress -36>>
<br><br>
<<badEndTrackingEnd "Underground Farm" { reason: "uFarmEscapedCentaurThank" }>>
