:: Livestock Escape Fail
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"죄-죄송해요!" 당신은 무릎을 꿇으며 말한다. "얌전히 있을게요! 때리지만 마세요."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please, I'm sorry," you say quickly. "I'll behave. Just don't do this."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
		"걱정 끼쳐드린 점 사과드립니다." 당신이 말한다. "하지만 이건 좀 심하네요."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
		"Consider me thoroughly corrected," you say. "Can we skip the spectacle?"
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		"Fine," you snap. "I ran. You caught me. Congratulations."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Fine," you say. "I shouldn't have run. Happy now?"
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"There," you spit. "You got your apology."
	<<else>>
		"죄송합니다." 당신이 말한다. "도망치지 말았어야 했어요."
	<</if>>
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"Wh-What you're doing is wrong," you say, spurred by a burst of courage. "You can't treat people like this."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"This is wrong," you say, voice shaking. "You can't keep hurting people like this."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
		"This is unlawful and cruel," you say. "You can't treat people like this."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
		"This is monstrous," you say, somehow finding enough breath to make it sound like an accusation. "And you know it."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"네 농장으로 썩 꺼지는 게 좋을 거야." 당신이 말한다. "안 그러면 네 꼴을 보게 될 테니."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"I'm not your livestock," you say. "You don't get to decide what I am."
	<<else>>
		"나는 소가 아니에요." 당신이 말한다. "나를 이렇게 대할 수는 없어요."
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		You say nothing. Whatever plea you might have made dies in your throat.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		You lower your eyes, silence taking the place of surrender.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
		You hold your tongue, refusing to give Remy one more word to twist against you.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
		For once, even you cannot find a line worth spending breath on.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		You bare your teeth and say nothing, saving what little strength you have.
	<<else>>
		당신은 아무 말도 하지 않고, 다음 타격을 준비한다.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

레미가 다시 한번 채찍을 내리치지만, 이번에는 채찍이 당신의 목을 감아 거의 숨이 막힐 지경이다. <<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 말을 움직여 채찍-목줄을 잡아당기며 당신을 뒤에 매달고 간다.
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	All you can do is stumble after <<him>>, choking down frightened little sounds whenever the whip tightens.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You try to keep pace before the pull can hurt worse, hating yourself for how quickly your body obeys.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	Humiliation burns hotter than the pain, but you can do nothing except stumble after <<him>>.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	There is no dignity in being dragged, no matter how fiercely you try to keep your head high.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident")>>
	You dig in your heels where you can, turning the drag into as ugly a struggle as possible.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	The rage in you is nearly bright enough to eclipse the fear.
<<else>>
	All you can do is endure the brutal pull of the leash.
<</if>>
<br><br>

마침내 농장 인부들이 따라잡아 당신 옆에 나란히 선다. 개들이 바로 뒤를 따른다. 언덕 꼭대기에 오르자 축사가 시야에 들어온다. 레미가 당신의 목에서 <<his>> 채찍을 풀어준다. 당신은 땅으로 굴러떨어진다.
<br><br>

